# 仓库内统一以 LF 存储，检出时由 Git 按平台处理
* text=auto

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换与合并
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp  binary
*.ico  binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.wasm binary

# 锁文件与产物
*.db   binary
*.pak  binary

# 语言统计：这些不该被识别为其他语言
*.md       text
package.json text
yarn.lock  text
